图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"microsandbox支持","id":"gh:1327532651","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"sandbox-micro","slug":"omdsh-dev/sandbox-micro","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","sandbox"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sandbox-microsandbox`"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DSH profile bundle for the fail-closed microsandbox microVM capability. The root package contains "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"the `ctx.microsandbox` provider and exports the model-facing tools as `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sandbox-micr"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"andbox` provider and exports the model-facing tools as `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sandbox-microsandbox/tool`."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Repository shape"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The single root artifact keeps Git/profile installation self-contained while preserving two Cordis e"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"oot artifact keeps Git/profile installation self-contained while preserving two Cordis entry points:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Both rows are disabled by the bundle. To enable the capability, a profile must explicitly enable the"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" provider with `config.enabled: true` and enable the tool row separately. This prevents installation"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" from starting a microVM capability or exposing model-facing tools implicitly."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Capability boundary"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"`ctx.microsandbox` is an environment-coherent microVM service, not a `dsh-sandbox` same-world provid"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"er. It uses the pinned `microsandbox@0.6.7` SDK, package-owned `msb` resolution, bounded functional "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"qualification, and fail-closed platform checks. It never degrades to unconfined host execution."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The tool entry exposes:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The old host integration patch remains under `legacy/` for DSH snapshots that do not yet provide the"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" provider/tool catalog and composition seams. A new bundle layer does not modify DSH host source."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"A full typecheck expects sibling checkouts:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The `prepare` script builds provider, invariant, and tool entries directly from `src/`, so a Git ins"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"tall does not require sibling project references. pnpm 10 may require the profile to allow the packa"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ge's prepare script; only approve a pinned, trusted checkout."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Model Experience"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The provider adds no prompt text. The tool subpath adds `microsandbox_exec` and `microsandbox_fs` to"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" the authoritative tools service; their output preserves guest exit codes, captured streams, runner "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"failures, timeout/abort classification, and guest file content."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Known Limitations and Deferred Work"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Linux requires `/dev/kvm`; unsupported or unqualified hosts remain unavailable.\n- macOS Apple Sili"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"con real-host acceptance is not included in the first release posture.\n- Secrets, network policy, sn"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"apshots, and image/volume lifecycle tools remain provider-only or fail closed.\n- The external SDK an"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"d platform binaries are pinned to `0.6.7` and require their corresponding registry packages."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
